<title>SWEDEN: Swedish industrial production fell 0.1 pct Feb.</title>
<headline>Swedish industrial production fell 0.1 pct Feb.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish industrial production fell 0.1 percent in February from January, Statistics Sweden said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Stastics Sweden said during the three months December-February the total production increased by 3.8 percent as compared to the preceding three months, September-November.</p>
<p> (Percentage change)   Feb 97   Jan 97     yr/yr</p>
<p>			     -0.1	-2.3	+7.8</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1045</p>
